WEBVTT

00:02:27.622 --> 00:02:30.435
Bitartean, hiru galdera 
egingo dizkizuet.

00:02:30.475 --> 00:02:33.000
Jakin nahi dut hitz horiekin 
zer gertatzen den.

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:34.257
Hona hemen hitzok:

00:02:34.327 --> 00:02:35.825
zuhaitz,

00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:39.840
autobide,

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.288
ispilu,

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:44.470
Saturno

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.789
eta elektrodo.

00:02:47.479 --> 00:02:49.023
Oraingoz ondo?

00:02:49.283 --> 00:02:50.917
Gustatuko litzaidake

00:02:51.017 --> 00:02:53.994
honen erantzuna ematea:

00:02:54.264 --> 00:02:56.586
8 bider 23

00:02:56.826 --> 00:02:58.540
Esan ozenki.